{"t":"Lion Trophy Quest","s":"lion-trophy-quest-909cc","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Route_to_Formorgar_Mines_37351a.jpg","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lion Trophy Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(45+ recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.00<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 26, 2007<br/>Summer Update 2007</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>It seems a poacher found his way into the mines, but did not make it out alive.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Penguin\">Penguin</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Winter%20Wolf\">Winter Wolf</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Polar%20Bear\">Polar Bear</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\">Frost Troll</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Novice%20of%20the%20Cult\">Novice of the Cult</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mammoth\">Mammoth</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Gargoyle\">Gargoyle</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Golem\">Ice Golem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golem</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyvern</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%20Trophy\">Lion Trophy</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Shard\">Shard</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Requirements\">Requirements</span></h2>\n<ul><li>You must have reached \"Formorgar Mines 1\" mission of the <a href=\"#/quest/the-ice-islands-quest\">The Ice Islands Quest</a>;</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Starting at the town of <a href=\"#/wiki/Svargrond\">Svargrond</a> you must go west, levitate up and follow the path towards the path to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Formorgar%20Mines\">Formorgar Mines</a>. Follow this map:</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route to Formorgar Mines\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"295\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_to_Formorgar_Mines_37351a.jpg\" width=\"536\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>At the end of the path, go down these <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32145,31123,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">stairs (32145, 31123, 7)</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lion Trophy Quest 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"386\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Trophy_Quest_1_3e8a84.jpg\" width=\"251\"/></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Rewards are in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Chest%20%28Quest%29\">Chest (Quest)</a> in the corner east from the stairs.</li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lion Trophy Quest 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lion_Trophy_Quest_2_b5c64c.jpg\" width=\"640\"/></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>","quests":["formorgar-mines-hoist-quest"]}